ata-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"312\">De MSI Apache Pro is een krachtige gaming laptop die geschikt is voor gaming, multimedia en dagelijks gebruik. Dankzij de Intel Core i7-processor, NVIDIA GTX 970M videokaart en de combinatie van SSD en HDD-opslag kun je soepel gamen en snel werken.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"403\"><strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"323\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"326\">Gebruikt, maar degelijk<br data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"352\">Zichtbare gebruikssporen mogelijk, 100% functioneel</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"648\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"420\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"423\">⭐ Intel Core i7 processor voor sterke prestaties<br data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"474\">⭐ NVIDIA GTX 970M dedicated videokaart<br data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"515\">⭐ Combinatie van snelle SSD en ruime HDD-opslag<br data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"565\">⭐ Geschikt voor gaming en multitasking<br data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\" data-is-only-node=\"\">⭐ Stevig gaming design met goede koeling</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"1036\">📋 <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"670\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"673\"><strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"687\">Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 (6e generatie)<br data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"719\"><strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"727\">RAM:</strong> 12GB DDR3<br data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"751\">Opslag:</strong> 256GB SSD + 1TB HDD<br data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"774\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"794\">Grafische kaart:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970M<br data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"821\"><strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"839\">Videogeheugen:</strong> 3GB / 6GB VRAM<br data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"868\">Scherm:</strong> 15.6 inch Full HD<br data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"889\"><strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"911\">Besturingssysteem:</strong> Windows 11<br data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"925\"><strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"944\">Connectiviteit:</strong> WiFi, Bluetooth, USB, HDMI<br data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"974\"><strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"984\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart / Rood<br data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\"><strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1010\">Staat:</strong> Gebruikt, maar degelijk</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1280\">📋 <strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1071\">Gameprestaties (schatting)</strong><br data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1074\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1087\">Fortnite:</strong> ± 60–80 FPS (1080p, Medium settings)<br data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1139\">Warzone:</strong> ± 35–45 FPS (1080p, Low settings)<br data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1176\"><strong data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1186\">GTA V:</strong> ± 70 FPS (1080p, High settings)<br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1235\">Minecraft:</strong> ± 200+ FPS (1080p, standaard instellingen)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1336\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1300\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1303\">MSI Apache Pro Laptop<br data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1327\">Oplader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1397\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1360\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1363\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n